WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.400 --> 00:06.401
[This drama is intended for entertainment purposes only.]

3
00:06.411 --> 00:08.400
[All characters, behaviors, locations, and events depicted are fictional.]

4
00:08.430 --> 00:09.950
[It is not intended to be sexually suggestive or to encourage viewers]

5
00:10.000 --> 00:11.501
[to engage in inappropriate or morally objectionable behavior.]

6
00:11.511 --> 00:12.890
[Nor is it intended to discredit any profession]

7
00:12.899 --> 00:13.900
[or create negative perceptions of any organization]

8
00:13.911 --> 00:14.912
[or any particular group of people.]

9
00:15.131 --> 00:17.600
I've got a little surprise for you. To make things more exciting.

10
00:17.632 --> 00:18.633
Just give me a moment.

11
00:20.633 --> 00:21.634
Ta.

12
00:21.651 --> 00:23.680
If you want to have fun, you'll have to be patient, Director.

13
00:25.560 --> 00:28.400
- Ta! - She left ages ago.

14
00:28.430 --> 00:29.640
She tricked you into booking this hotel room.

15
00:29.650 --> 00:31.720
Then she lured me here, hoping we'd end up fighting.

16
00:31.782 --> 00:32.783
I don't believe you!

17
00:32.818 --> 00:33.819
What are you doing?

18
00:33.825 --> 00:37.211
I've already proven to you that there's nothing wrong with me in bed.

19
00:37.226 --> 00:39.200
We could even see a marriage counselor together.

20
00:39.382 --> 00:40.440
See? This is exactly why.

21
00:40.566 --> 00:42.240
I went to get some toys from my car.

22
00:42.283 --> 00:44.059
But I ran into Nopnapha.

23
00:44.067 --> 00:46.840
Now I'm starting to wonder why you still won't divorce her.

24
00:46.854 --> 00:48.000
Could it be that you still love her?

25
00:48.055 --> 00:50.360
But you're the only one in my heart.

26
00:51.110 --> 00:54.600
This year's New Year's party, they said each department

27
00:54.816 --> 00:56.427
should put on one performance.

28
00:56.571 --> 00:58.960
But that means our division has to put on a show, too.

29
00:59.024 --> 01:00.240
What are you performing at the New Year's party?

30
01:00.250 --> 01:01.400
I'm not performing with them.

31
01:01.760 --> 01:02.800
Then why don't you perform with me?

32
01:03.150 --> 01:05.151
- I'll show my magic tricks. - Sure.

33
01:05.502 --> 01:06.590
I'll perform with you.

34
01:06.960 --> 01:09.280
Jolene, watch my livestream during the performance.

35
01:09.320 --> 01:10.680
And when the big moment comes,

36
01:10.819 --> 01:13.760
Take screenshots. Post them on every social media platform as fast as you can.

37
01:14.024 --> 01:15.955
This is going to be so much fun, Nopnapha will scream.

38
01:24.600 --> 01:26.601
[Thai Pattana Party]

39
01:46.856 --> 01:48.250
A hot drink for you.

40
01:54.232 --> 01:55.233
Thank you.

41
01:56.240 --> 01:57.560
I was just getting sleepy.

42
02:00.427 --> 02:01.560
Oh, it's tea.

43
02:01.680 --> 02:03.920
Could I have coffee instead? Sorry.

44
02:05.558 --> 02:07.250
But it's already half past midnight.

45
02:07.723 --> 02:10.320
I brought you chamomile tea on purpose, ma'am.

46
02:10.646 --> 02:11.920
It'll help you sleep better.

47
02:14.960 --> 02:17.051
I'm the first to speak in tomorrow's debate.

48
02:18.059 --> 02:21.640
The whole country will be watching. I won't be able to sleep.

49
02:23.480 --> 02:24.800
Thank you for the tea, though.

50
02:25.712 --> 02:27.440
I'd rather have coffee.

51
02:27.707 --> 02:30.640
Of course. I'll get you a coffee.

52
02:42.694 --> 02:44.280
If you need anything else,

53
02:44.912 --> 02:46.160
just let me know.

54
02:46.523 --> 02:48.000
I'll be on standby in the next room.

55
02:49.632 --> 02:50.904
And in the lounge,

56
02:52.000 --> 02:53.960
there's a large sofa bed.

57
02:54.950 --> 02:58.400
In case you'd like to take a nap.

58
03:00.000 --> 03:01.001
Don't worry.

59
03:02.464 --> 03:03.880
There's no one else in the building

60
03:05.371 --> 03:06.400
except the two of us.

61
03:16.323 --> 03:17.324
I'm pregnant.

62
03:20.595 --> 03:21.596
What?

63
03:22.292 --> 03:23.293
I'm sorry.

64
03:24.894 --> 03:26.000
I should've been more careful.

65
03:27.619 --> 03:30.424
Here's what we'll do. I'll take you to my friend's clinic.

66
03:30.808 --> 03:31.889
He can take care of it.

67
03:32.606 --> 03:33.607
No.

68
03:35.350 --> 03:36.560
I'm not having an abortion.

69
03:38.011 --> 03:39.424
I'm keeping this baby no matter what.

70
03:40.200 --> 03:41.627
But the election is just around the corner.

71
03:42.171 --> 03:43.974
How can you campaign with a big belly?

72
03:44.683 --> 03:45.880
Why couldn't I?

73
03:46.800 --> 03:48.201
A pregnant woman on the campaign trail

74
03:50.000 --> 03:52.491
might win even more votes from women.

75
03:55.934 --> 03:56.935
Phop.

76
03:57.900 --> 03:58.901
Let's get married.

77
04:10.544 --> 04:13.640
I know I'm not as capable as you.

78
04:15.584 --> 04:17.800
And I'll never rise as high as you.

79
04:22.352 --> 04:23.520
But I promise you

80
04:25.753 --> 04:26.880
I'll love you

81
04:28.414 --> 04:30.200
and always stand by your side.

82
04:36.731 --> 04:39.094
I'll have a one-of-a-kind ring made

83
04:40.300 --> 04:41.560
just for you.

84
04:43.620 --> 04:45.560
Because you're the most special person in my life.

85
06:08.144 --> 06:09.960
Let's meet at our usual hotel tonight.

86
06:10.432 --> 06:13.840
Let me make up for last time.

87
06:15.792 --> 06:16.793
Oh, by the way, Ta.

88
06:17.440 --> 06:20.840
That toy you said you'd use on me...

89
06:21.571 --> 06:22.600
Don't forget to bring it.

90
06:23.200 --> 06:24.480
I'm busy these days.

91
06:24.734 --> 06:27.160
I won't be free until after New Year's.

92
06:27.680 --> 06:29.640
What? Why?

93
06:30.300 --> 06:31.880
What are you doing that's keeping you so busy?

94
06:32.100 --> 06:34.200
I have to rehearse for the New Year's show with Veekit.

95
06:34.566 --> 06:35.567
What?

96
06:37.776 --> 06:39.360
How did you end up performing with him?

97
06:40.064 --> 06:41.065
He invited me.

98
06:41.312 --> 06:43.360
I thought it sounded interesting, so I said yes.

99
06:44.176 --> 06:45.760
You didn't invite me yourself, Director.

100
06:46.600 --> 06:48.801
Just wait till you see my show with Veekit.

101
06:49.336 --> 06:50.337
Ta.

102
06:51.427 --> 06:52.428
Ta.

103
07:14.728 --> 07:16.129
Don't you have to pick up the kids from school?

104
07:17.320 --> 07:18.840
I asked Oshi to pick them up instead.

105
07:23.720 --> 07:24.721
Hey.

106
07:37.400 --> 07:39.480
Can you make a rabbit appear? I want one.

107
07:39.939 --> 07:41.140
You should've told me earlier.

108
07:42.315 --> 07:44.656
I'll bring one tomorrow. Here, take this for now.

109
07:45.435 --> 07:46.436
I'm just kidding.

110
07:47.584 --> 07:50.230
So, what exactly do we have to do?

111
07:51.440 --> 07:54.400
Nothing much. Just hand me the props.

112
07:55.400 --> 07:57.840
Oh, but let's practice this trick first.

113
08:01.100 --> 08:02.101
Here.

114
08:02.598 --> 08:04.180
You'll have to get inside this box.

115
08:04.784 --> 08:06.450
There's a hidden compartment inside.

116
08:06.900 --> 08:07.901
Here, come over here.

117
08:09.696 --> 08:11.600
And when I open the box again,

118
08:12.526 --> 08:13.840
it'll be empty.

119
08:14.766 --> 08:17.360
But it'll be a bit dark and cramped in there.

120
08:22.982 --> 08:23.983
You'll be okay, right?

121
08:28.848 --> 08:29.849
Yeah.

122
08:30.310 --> 08:32.150
No problem at all.

123
08:38.579 --> 08:40.200
Why do you want to do a magic show?

124
08:45.200 --> 08:46.201
Ta.

125
09:05.691 --> 09:06.720
Look, I've got this trick too.

126
09:12.160 --> 09:14.720
Wow! How did you do that?

127
09:16.840 --> 09:18.000
Have you been practicing for days?

128
09:19.616 --> 09:20.720
I've been doing magic since I was a kid.

129
09:21.211 --> 09:23.160
I was a big fan of Criss Angel. He was so cool.

130
09:23.312 --> 09:24.560
I wanted to be cool like him.

131
09:26.102 --> 09:28.360
Who's Criss Angel?

132
09:28.848 --> 09:30.200
An American magician.

133
09:30.836 --> 09:32.320
The one with the rock-star look.

134
09:39.408 --> 09:42.176
What's wrong? I just asked why you wanted to do a magic show.

135
09:44.472 --> 09:45.848
I was a big fan of Criss Angel.

136
09:46.536 --> 09:48.160
I thought he was so cool when I was a kid.

137
09:48.360 --> 09:50.120
I wanted to be like him, so I started practicing.

138
09:50.712 --> 09:52.320
Who's Criss Angel?

139
09:59.552 --> 10:02.240
An American magician with a rock-star look.

140
10:05.416 --> 10:07.180
Come on, what else can you show me?

141
10:21.910 --> 10:24.440
Wow, I can't believe you can do that too!

142
10:25.296 --> 10:26.297
What else have you got?

143
10:26.790 --> 10:27.791
What does this one do?

144
10:35.470 --> 10:36.471
Pretty good, huh?

145
11:00.518 --> 11:01.519
Where's Ta?

146
11:02.763 --> 11:04.720
We finished rehearsing. She just left.

147
11:21.075 --> 11:22.760
Stop being so stubborn, Veekit.

148
11:23.307 --> 11:25.440
You're only going to annoy her.

149
11:26.340 --> 11:27.600
But even after she found out I was pursuing her,

150
11:28.832 --> 11:30.920
she still agreed to do the magic show with me.

151
11:31.936 --> 11:34.267
- What does that tell you? - She's just doing it to spite me.

152
11:35.102 --> 11:36.103
Because...

153
11:37.760 --> 11:39.600
I slept with Napha the other day.

154
11:40.700 --> 11:43.701
She'll never be interested in you, Veekit.

155
11:44.131 --> 11:45.280
Stop dreaming.

156
11:46.936 --> 11:48.947
But your relationship with Ta...

157
11:49.400 --> 11:51.440
- is impossible too. - Why would it be?

158
11:52.206 --> 11:53.416
We're in love.

159
11:54.867 --> 11:58.000
And I'm not treating her like a toy, as you think.

160
12:00.462 --> 12:03.600
I've never loved any woman this much before.

161
12:04.536 --> 12:05.537
I mean it.

162
12:06.990 --> 12:10.200
So stop trying to steal Ta from me.

163
12:10.755 --> 12:11.756
I won't let you have her.

164
12:42.920 --> 12:45.921
[Fun Finance Party! Happy New Year 2026]

165
12:49.246 --> 12:50.920
Hello, hello. One, two, three.

166
12:51.987 --> 12:53.388
Our next performance

167
12:53.931 --> 12:56.180
is one I'm especially excited to present

168
12:57.014 --> 12:58.520
from the Corporate Relations Department.

169
12:59.184 --> 13:03.480
Please give them your support.

170
13:26.440 --> 13:28.320
♪ Just one glance at you ♪

171
13:28.450 --> 13:31.480
♪ And I knew you'd stolen my heart ♪

172
13:31.835 --> 13:34.320
♪ I wish I could tell you how cute you are ♪

173
13:35.200 --> 13:38.101
♪ But I don't want to come on too strong ♪

174
13:42.192 --> 13:44.500
Is that all you've got? You call that dancing?

175
13:44.923 --> 13:47.040
Watch me. Come on!

176
13:48.192 --> 13:51.193
♪ I wish I could say, Call me when you get home ♪

177
13:53.040 --> 13:56.320
♪ Anyone else who calls will hear my ringback tone... ♪

178
13:57.072 --> 14:01.600
Wow! If they sing "Do Re Mi" or "Kin Jub Jib",

179
14:01.622 --> 14:02.760
I'll go up there and give them a tip.

180
14:05.024 --> 14:06.025
Don't you agree, darling?

181
14:06.443 --> 14:11.600
♪ Welcome to the heart deposit service ♪

182
14:12.960 --> 14:16.520
♪ Register your heart and take your number ♪

183
14:16.561 --> 14:18.520
♪ Leave your heart in safe hands ♪

184
14:21.000 --> 14:22.001
Where are you going?

185
14:22.500 --> 14:23.501
To take a piss.

186
14:25.901 --> 14:30.040
♪ Leave your heart with me ♪

187
14:30.200 --> 14:33.701
♪ Let's exchange numbers, oh, oh, oh! ♪

188
14:43.750 --> 14:44.751
Director.

189
14:45.551 --> 14:47.080
Want something even more exciting?

190
14:48.392 --> 14:49.520
Even more exciting?

191
14:50.440 --> 14:52.360
I'm already getting so turned on, Ta.

192
14:52.470 --> 14:55.600
Oh, you've got a little tail too. I love it.

193
14:58.323 --> 14:59.324
Director.

194
15:01.592 --> 15:03.080
I've got a special surprise for you.

195
15:09.630 --> 15:11.520
I love this side of you, Ta.

196
15:16.080 --> 15:17.920
You should've told me you liked tight spaces.

197
15:20.134 --> 15:21.135
Let me take that off for you.

198
15:22.326 --> 15:23.560
You take yours off first, Director.

199
15:24.255 --> 15:26.080
Come here. Let me help you.

200
15:42.731 --> 15:46.220
Director, let me grab a toy to spice things up.

201
15:46.910 --> 15:47.911
A toy?

202
15:48.515 --> 15:49.516
To spice things up?

203
15:50.339 --> 15:52.680
Why bother leaving the last piece on?

204
15:55.011 --> 15:57.240
Ta... Sweetheart?

205
15:58.742 --> 15:59.743
Ta? Ta!

206
16:03.163 --> 16:04.480
Whoa! What the hell?

207
16:05.280 --> 16:06.440
Why is it so cramped in here?

208
16:22.206 --> 16:23.207
Ta!

209
16:23.318 --> 16:24.720
It's our turn. Let's go.

210
16:35.467 --> 16:37.600
Ta, sweetheart! Where are you?

211
16:38.040 --> 16:39.240
I can't get out, Ta!

212
16:41.230 --> 16:45.000
Thank you all for sitting through the entire show.

213
16:45.691 --> 16:49.200
If you're in the bathroom, hurry back.

214
16:49.552 --> 16:51.200
Especially you ladies!

215
16:51.542 --> 16:53.280
Because our next act

216
16:53.568 --> 16:59.232
is a magic show by Veekit from the Personnel Department.

217
17:03.568 --> 17:05.169
Veekit is so handsome.

218
17:05.360 --> 17:06.640
Veekit!

219
17:43.979 --> 17:45.320
Oh! A bird!

220
17:45.878 --> 17:46.960
That's right!

221
17:47.168 --> 17:51.369
And more importantly, it looks classier than a swan.

222
18:09.398 --> 18:10.880
Where did the bottle go?

223
18:11.174 --> 18:13.850
Exactly! Won't the glass shatter in his hand?

224
18:15.424 --> 18:16.840
What's that on the table?

225
18:17.046 --> 18:18.047
That's a candle.

226
18:18.800 --> 18:20.080
It looks so tempting to sit on.

227
18:21.880 --> 18:22.881
Hey! Hey!

228
18:24.043 --> 18:26.760
Hey, what if we actually work at the Ministry of Magic?

229
18:26.971 --> 18:28.800
You're right! Dumbledore! Dumbledore!

230
18:29.867 --> 18:30.868
Hagrid!

231
18:32.811 --> 18:33.812
Dobby!

232
18:43.147 --> 18:44.148
What's that?

233
18:44.411 --> 18:45.830
Ooh, what's happening? This is exciting.

234
18:51.412 --> 18:52.413
Ta.

235
18:52.968 --> 18:53.969
Oh, come on.

236
18:54.520 --> 18:55.521
Ta!

237
19:27.971 --> 19:29.560
Serves that homewrecker right. She's gone.

238
19:29.840 --> 19:30.841
Exactly, Auntie!

239
20:14.896 --> 20:16.360
Now I see why

240
20:16.544 --> 20:18.840
you have so many girls, sir.

241
20:19.062 --> 20:20.841
Anaconda!

242
20:20.955 --> 20:22.600
Boa... Nguu yak!

243
20:22.880 --> 20:26.080
Eww! A snake! I'm scared of snakes.

244
20:28.379 --> 20:30.920
That black magic is powerful.

245
20:31.488 --> 20:33.250
Do you believe in the Naga?

246
20:35.379 --> 20:37.960
- Zoom in! Zoom in! - Send it to me too!

247
20:42.219 --> 20:44.520
Looks like we're getting a bonus!

248
21:08.240 --> 21:10.480
What a wonderful show, everyone.

249
21:10.720 --> 21:12.760
You've really done our ministry proud.

250
21:12.960 --> 21:14.200
Give them a round of applause.

251
21:18.532 --> 21:21.080
That was one hell of a show.

252
21:21.416 --> 21:22.560
What a huge show!

253
21:23.363 --> 21:25.720
That was spectacular! Wow!

254
21:29.838 --> 21:32.440
A bright new year dawns upon our nation.

255
21:32.830 --> 21:35.240
May joy and prosperity spread throughout the land.

256
21:35.571 --> 21:38.400
Together, we shall build a thriving nation.

257
21:38.547 --> 21:41.220
United as one, the people and government stand.

258
21:41.352 --> 21:43.200
I, Narong Kuldamrongkitti,

259
21:43.438 --> 21:45.680
the Prime Minister, together with my Cabinet,

260
21:45.816 --> 21:49.400
would like to wish all Thai citizens

261
21:49.803 --> 21:50.804
a very Happy New Year.

262
21:52.000 --> 21:53.801
- Happy New Year! - Happy New Year!

263
21:54.720 --> 21:55.721
Cut!

264
22:03.998 --> 22:04.999
Ms. Nopnapha.

265
22:06.110 --> 22:07.480
Do you have any other appointments?

266
22:08.512 --> 22:11.003
I have a meeting with the central bank governor, sir.

267
22:11.286 --> 22:12.560
Is there something you need, Prime Minister?

268
22:13.040 --> 22:14.041
Postpone it.

269
22:14.966 --> 22:16.078
There's something I want to discuss with you.

270
22:19.000 --> 22:20.001
Of course.

271
22:32.656 --> 22:34.320
My face when I see this semester's grades.

272
22:35.147 --> 22:37.600
My face watching the Asian Games opening ceremony.

273
22:38.278 --> 22:41.360
My face when I wake up and Narong is still Prime Minister.

274
22:50.758 --> 22:52.120
How do you feel when you see these videos?

275
22:55.371 --> 22:58.000
I think kids these days are very creative.

276
22:58.022 --> 23:00.440
And they have a good sense of humor too.

277
23:01.280 --> 23:04.640
You're turning the government into a laughingstock.

278
23:05.872 --> 23:07.720
And undermining its credibility.

279
23:11.664 --> 23:13.360
The government's credibility

280
23:14.550 --> 23:16.480
depends on whether we can deliver

281
23:16.551 --> 23:18.520
on our campaign promises.

282
23:19.248 --> 23:20.800
And according to the polls,

283
23:21.158 --> 23:24.440
the three ministries under my party's control

284
23:24.774 --> 23:27.400
have the highest public approval ratings.

285
23:29.344 --> 23:30.560
As for personal gain,

286
23:31.086 --> 23:34.087
I've never been careless enough to get caught,

287
23:34.296 --> 23:36.180
unlike certain other ministers.

288
23:38.296 --> 23:41.050
My husband just put on a raunchy show at a party.

289
23:41.989 --> 23:44.595
I doubt that threatens the government's stability.

290
23:45.379 --> 23:47.235
Good performance is certainly important.

291
23:48.948 --> 23:52.800
But I'm talking about a minister who delivers results

292
23:53.102 --> 23:54.360
and maintains a good public image,

293
23:55.416 --> 23:57.678
versus one who delivers results but has a tarnished reputation.

294
24:00.440 --> 24:01.640
Which one do you think I'd choose?

295
24:03.736 --> 24:06.737
I can't control my husband's performances.

296
24:07.592 --> 24:09.560
That's not a minister's responsibility.

297
24:10.557 --> 24:14.280
My duty is to deliver great results for the people.

298
24:17.395 --> 24:18.478
That's just how women are.

299
24:19.502 --> 24:20.503
What do you mean by that?

300
24:21.150 --> 24:22.920
You can't even control your own husband.

301
24:24.374 --> 24:25.575
So if one day

302
24:25.979 --> 24:28.294
he commits a serious crime,

303
24:28.368 --> 24:30.520
like rape, murder, or drug trafficking,

304
24:30.980 --> 24:32.680
will you still say it has nothing to do with you

305
24:33.232 --> 24:35.680
and won't affect the government?

306
24:42.283 --> 24:46.800
Prime Minister, I think at the next Cabinet reshuffle meeting,

307
24:47.195 --> 24:49.850
this issue should be at the top of the agenda.

308
24:52.758 --> 24:53.810
Prime Minister, please.

309
24:55.000 --> 24:56.998
If you remove me from my position,

310
24:57.280 --> 24:59.250
you'll be playing right into the opposition's hands.

311
25:00.123 --> 25:02.280
They're the ones who leaked the video

312
25:02.558 --> 25:04.600
and spread those memes to discredit me.

313
25:07.262 --> 25:08.680
From what I've heard,

314
25:09.365 --> 25:12.250
the first person to share the video wasn't from the opposition.

315
25:14.382 --> 25:15.800
It was a woman named

316
25:17.070 --> 25:18.071
Mutta.

317
25:24.664 --> 25:25.840
I've known about this for a long time,

318
25:27.192 --> 25:28.360
but I didn't want to bring it up

319
25:28.910 --> 25:30.500
because I considered it a personal matter.

320
25:33.085 --> 25:36.320
But things have gone too far now. Deal with it quickly.

321
25:37.443 --> 25:40.320
I care more about the government's image than its achievements.

322
25:48.379 --> 25:50.459
It's 4 p.m. Office hours are over.

323
25:50.560 --> 25:52.500
Come back tomorrow at nine.

324
25:53.987 --> 25:55.320
But if it were that bitch Mutta,

325
25:56.259 --> 25:58.920
you'd be open for business 24 hours a day, wouldn't you?

326
26:02.707 --> 26:03.708
Of course.

327
26:05.411 --> 26:07.100
You got so close to her

328
26:07.412 --> 26:09.760
without realizing she was plotting to destroy us.

329
26:11.123 --> 26:12.662
Having a cheating husband

330
26:12.752 --> 26:14.760
- isn't as embarrassing as having a stupid one. - Watch it!

331
26:16.753 --> 26:18.667
If your blood sugar's low, go drink something sweet.

332
26:19.154 --> 26:20.680
Don't take it out on your husband.

333
26:21.846 --> 26:24.320
You're lucky you're only getting yelled at by your wife.

334
26:24.467 --> 26:26.168
I got chewed out by the Prime Minister.

335
26:27.491 --> 26:29.650
The entire Cabinet knows about that bitch Mutta now.

336
26:31.272 --> 26:33.920
If I can't even deal with one lousy mistress,

337
26:34.286 --> 26:35.760
they're going to kick me out of office.

338
26:39.550 --> 26:41.560
You're scared of a stupid threat like that?

339
26:43.368 --> 26:46.760
Come on, you've got 120 MPs. What's there to fear?

340
26:47.283 --> 26:50.880
If they keep threatening you, just join the opposition.

341
26:51.502 --> 26:53.760
A minority government won't survive anyway.

342
26:54.032 --> 26:56.960
Come on! You're a rising political star right now.

343
26:57.126 --> 27:00.080
You'll win by a landslide in the next election.

344
27:01.344 --> 27:03.840
Good thing I never let you go into politics.

345
27:04.784 --> 27:07.640
Do you really think that if I join the opposition,

346
27:07.685 --> 27:09.360
all those MPs will follow me?

347
27:09.867 --> 27:12.960
And more importantly, if I haven't launched the Smart Card project,

348
27:13.115 --> 27:15.160
what will I campaign on in the next election?

349
27:19.083 --> 27:20.084
Phop.

350
27:20.822 --> 27:22.390
If you won't do it for me,

351
27:23.195 --> 27:24.800
then do it for yourself.

352
27:26.342 --> 27:29.480
Because the higher I rise, the higher you'll rise with me.

353
27:30.102 --> 27:31.203
But if I fall,

354
27:31.798 --> 27:34.500
you'll be nothing more than a lowly civil servant.

355
27:36.899 --> 27:40.120
Stay away from that bitch Mutta, for your own sake.

356
27:51.600 --> 27:52.768
Touch and Oshi,

357
27:53.904 --> 27:56.700
we need to find a way to get rid of that bitch once and for all.

358
28:37.928 --> 28:38.829
What?

359
28:38.880 --> 28:41.040
Someone's following me in a car.

360
28:42.211 --> 28:45.120
I think she's making her move. She's sent someone to kill me.

361
28:45.472 --> 28:48.200
Seriously? Your dashcam's recording, right?

362
28:48.758 --> 28:50.960
Yeah, both front and rear cameras.

363
28:51.707 --> 28:52.920
Get over here right now.

364
28:53.264 --> 28:54.840
And bring the phone signal detector.

365
28:54.960 --> 28:56.640
Okay. Be careful.

366
29:35.227 --> 29:36.400
What is it, Mr. Thaithat?

367
29:36.736 --> 29:38.360
She sent me to escort you to see her.

368
29:38.811 --> 29:40.160
She's waiting at the Ministry.

369
29:42.556 --> 29:43.557
Okay.

370
29:54.608 --> 29:55.609
Hey.

371
29:56.384 --> 29:57.885
She wants me to meet her at the Ministry.

372
29:58.123 --> 29:59.320
That's dangerous.

373
29:59.360 --> 30:01.560
If she locks you in a room and kills you, no one will ever know.

374
30:02.616 --> 30:04.120
Then I'll turn on my voice recorder.

375
30:04.640 --> 30:05.841
If she tries anything,

376
30:06.441 --> 30:07.480
you'll have evidence.

377
30:07.584 --> 30:09.240
Hey, isn't that too risky?

378
30:28.336 --> 30:29.520
May I see your phone, please?

379
30:52.056 --> 30:53.057
This way, please.

380
31:10.096 --> 31:13.360
Isn't summoning someone after office hours against regulations?

381
31:13.414 --> 31:14.415
[Nopnapha Jetsadaphiban]

382
31:14.420 --> 31:15.480
[Minister of Digital Finance]

383
31:24.056 --> 31:25.357
Are you going to stand there and talk?

384
31:31.491 --> 31:32.960
No need to be so nervous.

385
31:34.040 --> 31:36.160
This isn't a Committee Hearing Room.

386
31:37.598 --> 31:40.300
Just a wife wanting to talk to her husband's mistress.

387
31:42.170 --> 31:43.171
I'm honored.

388
31:43.326 --> 31:45.982
To be summoned here by you for a personal matter.

389
31:47.206 --> 31:48.207
Yes.

390
31:48.518 --> 31:50.480
It should've been a private matter.

391
31:51.659 --> 31:53.760
But you made it public

392
31:54.464 --> 31:56.920
the day you forced Phop to put on that show onstage.

393
31:59.065 --> 32:01.766
No, it was started when you slapped me down the Ministry steps.

394
32:02.384 --> 32:04.240
People have been gossiping about us for ages.

395
32:04.870 --> 32:06.071
What are you so afraid of?

396
32:07.264 --> 32:08.800
And let me make one thing clear.

397
32:09.800 --> 32:11.001
From now on,

398
32:12.086 --> 32:16.160
I'll be even more affectionate with the Director in public.

399
32:17.120 --> 32:20.160
Especially when you're watching.

400
32:21.339 --> 32:22.340
Do you know why?

401
32:24.859 --> 32:26.600
Because you're a rotten little bitch.

402
32:27.686 --> 32:29.520
Because I know there's nothing you can do

403
32:30.251 --> 32:31.252
but sit there and take it.

404
32:32.816 --> 32:34.040
And next time,

405
32:34.742 --> 32:36.443
I'll smile at you again.

406
32:37.163 --> 32:39.000
I just love the look on your face.

407
32:39.520 --> 32:42.600
It's hilarious. I could make so many more memes out of it.

408
33:18.011 --> 33:19.012
Ten million.

409
33:23.230 --> 33:25.760
I hope that's enough to buy my husband back.

410
33:32.710 --> 33:36.080
The Director's worth more than ten million in bed.

411
33:39.280 --> 33:41.552
This isn't a government procurement deal

412
33:41.659 --> 33:43.250
that you can close by throwing money at it.

413
33:46.896 --> 33:47.897
Keep your money.

414
33:48.726 --> 33:50.700
You might need it to pay for a man someday.

415
33:53.144 --> 33:54.145
Thank you

416
33:54.600 --> 33:57.040
for letting me live this long,

417
33:57.801 --> 34:00.250
so I can keep enjoying myself with the Director.

418
34:01.300 --> 34:04.440
And watch you suffer like this for a long time to come.

419
34:05.600 --> 34:06.601
If you'll excuse me.

420
34:09.451 --> 34:10.452
You bitch, Mutta!

421
34:10.837 --> 34:12.320
Come here! Come here!

422
34:13.120 --> 34:14.121
Get over here!

423
34:15.376 --> 34:19.440
I'll kill you, Mutta! You homewrecking bitch!

424
34:25.605 --> 34:27.050
Ma'am, what's going on?

425
34:27.800 --> 34:28.880
I'll kill her!

426
34:29.454 --> 34:30.797
- I'll kill her! - Calm down, ma'am. Please calm down.

427
34:32.195 --> 34:34.400
Call a hitman and have her shot right now!

428
34:34.488 --> 34:36.560
We can't do that, ma'am. It's too risky.

429
34:36.691 --> 34:40.400
And did throwing money at her like you suggested work? Huh?

430
34:40.493 --> 34:42.382
- I'll kill her! - Please calm down, ma'am.

431
34:45.069 --> 34:49.040
Ma'am, now that photos of the Director with a sex doll have leaked,

432
34:49.070 --> 34:51.600
are you worried about the damage to your reputation?

433
34:52.635 --> 34:54.960
Not at all. It was just an internal celebration.

434
34:55.280 --> 34:57.200
It may have been a little risqué, that's all.

435
34:57.539 --> 34:59.140
But the younger staff seemed to enjoy it.

436
34:59.160 --> 35:00.760
They didn't expect the Director to go all out like that.

437
35:02.971 --> 35:06.600
I think we should talk about the Smart Card project instead.

438
35:06.800 --> 35:07.801
Oh, yes.

439
35:07.810 --> 35:10.523
How far along is the Smart Card project now?

440
35:10.896 --> 35:14.600
We've already issued an invitation to bid through e-bidding.

441
35:14.920 --> 35:17.490
We haven't made the terms of reference too restrictive,

442
35:17.500 --> 35:20.680
because we want to give young entrepreneurs and smaller companies

443
35:20.701 --> 35:22.760
a chance to submit their bids too.

444
35:24.683 --> 35:27.560
What do you think the chances of success are?

445
35:27.600 --> 35:28.760
One hundred percent, of course.

446
35:30.670 --> 35:32.071
In the initial phase,

447
35:32.171 --> 35:34.840
we'll combine services from all three ministries:

448
35:34.860 --> 35:37.880
finance, healthcare, and transportation, all on one card.

449
35:38.168 --> 35:41.960
My party already oversees all three ministries, so there won't be any problems.

450
35:42.571 --> 35:44.080
- That's wonderful. - That's great news.

451
35:44.507 --> 35:47.880
This project has always been your party's flagship policy.

452
35:48.022 --> 35:49.397
If you become Prime Minister in the next term,

453
35:49.558 --> 35:52.910
could all government services be integrated into a single card?

454
35:53.342 --> 35:55.680
- That's a good question. - You've got my support!

455
35:56.328 --> 35:59.360
We're still serving under Prime Minister Narong.

456
35:59.502 --> 36:02.520
It wouldn't be appropriate to discuss the next term just yet.

457
36:02.920 --> 36:04.840
Let's leave that for the future.

458
36:05.374 --> 36:08.640
When do you think the Smart Card will be launched?

459
36:08.835 --> 36:12.160
We've set a timeline of about three months.

460
36:12.411 --> 36:15.480
We should see some concrete progress by the middle of this year.

461
36:16.043 --> 36:17.360
I just can't picture it.

462
36:17.867 --> 36:20.680
This woman jumped over a table and tried to strangle you?

463
36:22.440 --> 36:24.120
I thought she'd send someone to attack you.

464
36:24.446 --> 36:25.600
Too bad we didn't get any evidence.

465
36:27.646 --> 36:30.200
The government's term is almost over, and elections are coming up.

466
36:30.600 --> 36:32.800
She's probably being careful to avoid any scandals.

467
36:35.526 --> 36:37.700
We need to find a way to mess with her career.

468
36:40.283 --> 36:42.284
Why don't we bid on her Smart Card project?

469
36:42.638 --> 36:44.080
It's her biggest project, you know.

470
36:45.160 --> 36:48.360
No way. Government contracts require deep pockets

471
36:48.883 --> 36:50.080
because payments take forever.

472
36:50.387 --> 36:53.520
A small company like ours doesn't stand a chance.

473
37:07.275 --> 37:08.500
I'm here to see the Minister.

474
37:08.944 --> 37:10.245
She's busy all day.

475
37:10.747 --> 37:12.158
You can leave a message with me.

476
37:13.214 --> 37:14.815
Then please tell her

477
37:15.107 --> 37:18.108
I've agreed to take the money and stay away from the Director.

478
37:23.707 --> 37:25.408
Don't believe her, ma'am. That homewrecking bitch.

479
37:25.846 --> 37:28.160
You'd be better off trusting a thief than her.

480
37:32.678 --> 37:34.079
But I don't want to miss this opportunity.

481
37:35.552 --> 37:37.350
She's finally accepted our offer.

482
37:40.374 --> 37:44.400
Then I guess I'll take a chance and be a fool to trust her.

483
37:52.375 --> 37:53.376
Veekit.

484
37:56.984 --> 37:58.264
Hey, Veekit.

485
37:59.747 --> 38:00.748
Still mad at me?

486
38:03.688 --> 38:06.691
You look even more like an alpaca when you're angry.

487
38:14.478 --> 38:15.479
It's not funny.

488
38:16.100 --> 38:18.160
You stuffed Uncle Phop into that cabinet without telling me.

489
38:19.000 --> 38:20.301
How do you think I'm supposed to feel?

490
38:22.500 --> 38:23.501
Amused, maybe?

491
38:23.824 --> 38:26.160
I just wanted our show to be the talk of the town.

492
38:30.859 --> 38:32.960
You were deliberately trying to provoke Aunt Napha. I could tell.

493
38:34.235 --> 38:35.680
I've noticed it several times now, Ta.

494
38:37.243 --> 38:38.520
Why are you doing this? Just tell me.

495
38:41.995 --> 38:43.240
You're not my guardian.

496
38:44.160 --> 38:47.520
You don't get to watch my every move or control what I do.

497
38:48.246 --> 38:49.659
If you're that upset with me,

498
38:50.134 --> 38:51.720
- Then let's just stay out of each other's lives. - No, no.

499
38:53.798 --> 38:55.640
I never said I didn't want anything to do with you.

500
38:56.966 --> 38:57.967
I just feel like

501
38:59.221 --> 39:01.046
I need to be more careful around you, that's all.

502
39:02.470 --> 39:04.760
If it's that much trouble, I won't bother you anymore.

503
39:09.471 --> 39:10.472
That's mine.

504
39:18.357 --> 39:20.320
Would you like to have lunch with me?

505
39:21.056 --> 39:23.720
- I've already eaten. - Who are you here to see? Me?

506
39:23.757 --> 39:24.760
I'm here to see Mutta.

507
39:26.496 --> 39:28.480
Oh, Ta!

508
39:28.571 --> 39:30.360
Where have you been slacking off?

509
39:30.558 --> 39:32.280
Thaithat has been waiting for you.

510
39:32.675 --> 39:34.960
Yes. She wants to see you right away.

511
39:35.278 --> 39:36.440
Are you busy with anything?

512
39:37.864 --> 39:39.400
No, I'm free. I can go.

513
39:40.125 --> 39:41.126
Please take care of this for me.

514
39:50.230 --> 39:52.560
Hey, ladies, want to take a guess?

515
39:53.000 --> 39:55.720
What do you think Mrs. Nopnapha

516
39:55.995 --> 39:57.296
is going to scold her for?

517
39:57.300 --> 39:59.920
Maybe she's not calling her in to scold her.

518
40:00.064 --> 40:03.357
Maybe she's giving her a pay raise.

519
40:04.486 --> 40:06.180
More like a pay cut!

520
40:06.627 --> 40:07.628
Hey, Meow.

521
40:07.726 --> 40:10.080
How are we supposed to find out

522
40:10.527 --> 40:12.240
what Nopnapha's going to scold her for?

523
40:15.640 --> 40:16.800
What's so hard about that?

524
40:17.165 --> 40:21.040
Just turn into a fruit fly,

525
40:21.066 --> 40:22.600
buzz around them, and find out, you idiot.

526
40:23.280 --> 40:24.479
But I know something.

527
40:24.821 --> 40:25.822
Oops.

528
40:31.294 --> 40:35.480
Well, I overheard someone talking about it.

529
40:35.656 --> 40:36.657
- What did they say? - What did they say?

530
40:38.968 --> 40:40.320
Apparently,

531
40:41.112 --> 40:44.280
Mrs. Nopnapha was furious about the New Year's party.

532
40:45.227 --> 40:49.275
Ta deliberately lured the Director into the cabinet

533
40:49.900 --> 40:51.400
and made him come out

534
40:53.616 --> 40:55.840
with a sex doll to humiliate her.

535
40:58.952 --> 41:00.320
And that's not all.

536
41:01.374 --> 41:04.185
They also said the underwear the doll was wearing

537
41:04.935 --> 41:06.591
belonged to Ta.

538
41:09.670 --> 41:12.360
I really didn't want to spread any gossip.

539
41:12.811 --> 41:17.115
But since you're all so curious, I thought I'd share just a little.

540
41:19.798 --> 41:20.799
Everyone!

541
41:21.495 --> 41:23.300
Please don't tell anyone, okay?

542
41:23.496 --> 41:25.520
- Okay. - Okay.

543
41:54.915 --> 41:58.120
You said my husband was worth more than ten million in bed.

544
41:59.902 --> 42:02.320
Has the sex gotten boring? Is that why you changed your mind?

545
42:04.158 --> 42:05.480
I owe you an apology.

546
42:05.635 --> 42:08.024
I only said that to get under your skin.

547
42:08.616 --> 42:09.800
I've come to my senses now.

548
42:10.069 --> 42:12.837
Money is more important than any man.

549
42:13.424 --> 42:14.725
Don't you agree, ma'am?

550
42:16.310 --> 42:17.600
Why didn't you realize that sooner?

551
42:18.475 --> 42:20.176
I didn't need the money back then.

552
42:27.950 --> 42:29.480
And how can I be sure

553
42:30.846 --> 42:32.080
that once you get the money,

554
42:33.043 --> 42:34.600
you'll really leave my husband alone?

555
42:37.192 --> 42:40.320
All I can give you is my word.

556
42:41.000 --> 42:42.401
I'm a woman of my word.

557
43:34.395 --> 43:36.880
Someone go ask that homewrecking bitch what happened to her.

558
43:40.091 --> 43:42.520
Meow, with that foul mouth of yours, you're perfect for the job.

559
43:44.910 --> 43:47.960
Oh, no way! Look at her face. I'm scared she'll snap at me.

560
43:48.112 --> 43:50.600
Whisky, you're the closest to her. Go ask!

561
43:52.400 --> 43:55.560
The closer we are, the less I should ask.

562
43:56.600 --> 43:59.120
Chuenchom, you're always asking stupid questions anyway.

563
43:59.339 --> 44:00.440
Why don't you go ask her?

564
44:01.691 --> 44:04.320
- Yeah! - Exactly!

565
44:08.486 --> 44:11.240
You're all just as curious about Ta as I am.

566
44:11.400 --> 44:13.920
Why am I the only one who has to ask?

567
44:19.534 --> 44:21.360
Why are you all so nosy about other people's business?

568
44:22.104 --> 44:23.720
Will knowing the answer make your lives any better?

569
44:25.500 --> 44:27.038
Well...

570
44:27.342 --> 44:29.243
We're Thai, after all.

571
44:29.270 --> 44:31.320
It's only natural to take an interest in other people's lives.

572
44:31.830 --> 44:34.531
We just noticed you looked stressed earlier.

573
44:34.731 --> 44:36.840
We thought maybe there was something we could help with.

574
44:39.718 --> 44:40.719
Actually,

575
44:41.750 --> 44:44.151
the Minister called me in to receive an Outstanding Civil Servant Award.

576
44:46.200 --> 44:48.520
For minding my own damn business.

577
44:52.920 --> 44:54.320
- Ten million. - Ten million.

578
44:58.648 --> 44:59.840
- Ten million. - Ten million.

579
45:20.491 --> 45:21.700
Here's your chamomile tea, ma'am.

580
45:26.846 --> 45:27.987
I'd like a sleeping pill tonight.

581
45:30.387 --> 45:31.388
Of course, ma'am.

582
45:32.763 --> 45:33.764
Do you think

583
45:34.902 --> 45:37.000
someone like her will keep her word?

584
45:40.539 --> 45:42.720
I don't mean to stress you out even more, ma'am.

585
45:44.728 --> 45:46.300
But if I'm being realistic,

586
45:48.083 --> 45:49.200
it's hard to believe she will.

587
45:52.734 --> 45:53.960
Then make that two pills.

588
45:55.470 --> 45:56.471
Of course.

589
45:57.662 --> 45:58.800
But even if it's unlikely,

590
46:00.360 --> 46:01.880
there's still a chance, right?

591
46:05.224 --> 46:06.720
You'll have to put her to the test, ma'am.

592
46:08.334 --> 46:09.800
Whenever there's a long weekend,

593
46:10.254 --> 46:12.600
Mr. Jenphop usually takes Mutta on a trip.

594
46:14.000 --> 46:17.601
There's a substitute holiday this weekend.

595
46:18.688 --> 46:20.089
Why don't you ask him

596
46:21.579 --> 46:22.760
if he's planning to go anywhere?

597
46:36.371 --> 46:37.680
Mommy!

598
46:38.286 --> 46:41.087
For my birthday, I want this Bambinana Red Hat.

599
46:44.080 --> 46:45.081
Okay.

600
46:45.481 --> 46:47.082
Go to bed, sweetie. I have a headache.

601
46:47.926 --> 46:51.520
You have to buy it on the 25th. It's only on sale that day.

602
46:51.883 --> 46:53.760
I'll have Oshi take care of it.

603
46:55.523 --> 46:56.640
Don't forget!

604
47:01.683 --> 47:02.840
The 25th, okay?

605
47:02.884 --> 47:03.920
Okay.

606
47:21.776 --> 47:22.777
Yes, Director?

607
47:22.928 --> 47:25.360
Ta, let's go to Hong Kong over the long weekend.

608
47:27.339 --> 47:29.200
I haven't taken you shopping in ages.

609
47:29.600 --> 47:32.400
Oh, and I'll take you to your favorite dim sum restaurant too.

610
47:33.595 --> 47:34.840
And after we're done eating, we can...

611
47:35.883 --> 47:37.040
have some fun.

612
47:37.500 --> 47:39.320
Fun... the kind of fun...

613
47:40.278 --> 47:42.200
without anyone getting in our way this time.

614
47:44.032 --> 47:45.033
I'd rather not.

615
47:45.336 --> 47:48.080
Director, I think we should take a break.

616
47:48.360 --> 47:49.520
And please don't contact me again.

617
47:49.822 --> 47:51.623
I'm blocking you on everything.

618
47:51.950 --> 47:52.951
- Bye. - What?

619
47:54.151 --> 47:56.200
Blocking me? Ta...

620
47:56.688 --> 47:58.889
Ta? Hello? Hello?

621
48:00.363 --> 48:01.364
What the hell? Why'd she block me?

622
48:04.912 --> 48:06.800
Honey, are you asleep?

623
48:07.592 --> 48:08.593
Wait, wait.

624
48:21.883 --> 48:22.884
What is it?

625
48:25.771 --> 48:27.640
I'm having a barbecue this Saturday.

626
48:28.416 --> 48:29.417
Are you free?

627
48:32.480 --> 48:35.046
Yeah, I'm free.

628
48:36.139 --> 48:37.140
I'm not going anywhere.

629
48:39.712 --> 48:40.713
That sounds nice.

630
48:41.574 --> 48:42.960
We haven't had a barbecue in ages.

631
48:45.550 --> 48:47.440
I wonder if the grill still works.

632
48:48.430 --> 48:49.431
I'll go check.

633
49:03.734 --> 49:05.960
Ta, what did I do wrong?

634
49:06.735 --> 49:07.840
Can you please tell me?

635
49:11.283 --> 49:13.080
Your silence is really worrying me.

636
49:13.680 --> 49:15.760
Dad, can you come take a look now?

637
49:17.264 --> 49:18.265
Go ask your mom.

638
49:18.700 --> 49:19.701
Come on!

639
49:21.782 --> 49:24.523
Whenever we ask you anything, you always tell us to ask Mom.

640
49:24.783 --> 49:25.784
What's your problem?

641
49:33.147 --> 49:35.270
Yeah, it's ready. Take it off the grill.

642
49:35.707 --> 49:37.708
Nice and juicy. Just right.

643
49:40.312 --> 49:41.960
What have you kids been cooking?

644
49:43.688 --> 49:44.920
Oh my goodness!

645
49:45.123 --> 49:48.160
It's still so red! You can't eat that! You'll get sick!

646
49:48.744 --> 49:50.440
But Dad said it was ready.

647
49:50.600 --> 49:51.601
He said it was nice and juicy.

648
49:52.147 --> 49:54.250
Oh, for goodness' sake!

649
49:56.280 --> 49:58.521
Honey, come here.

650
50:05.549 --> 50:07.848
My party oversees the Ministry of Health.

651
50:08.264 --> 50:10.920
Wouldn't it be embarrassing

652
50:11.019 --> 50:12.130
if our whole family ended up with tapeworms?

653
50:12.140 --> 50:13.720
Are you crazy? How can you eat that?

654
50:15.641 --> 50:17.000
Oh my gosh!

655
50:17.323 --> 50:19.760
Kids, you can't eat meat that looks like this.

656
50:20.635 --> 50:24.560
- So much for Dad's juicy meat. We'll get diarrhea. - Spaghetti's ready!

657
50:25.664 --> 50:27.963
- It's piping hot! Come and get it. - Veekit.

658
50:28.697 --> 50:30.198
Veekit.

659
50:30.531 --> 50:32.200
Could you serve some for me too?

660
50:32.286 --> 50:34.560
Just a little, though. I don't want to gain weight.

661
50:34.880 --> 50:35.981
Sure.

662
50:36.120 --> 50:37.886
Can you make me some punch?

663
50:37.920 --> 50:39.934
Not too sweet, please. I'm watching my weight too.

664
50:40.000 --> 50:41.001
Okay.

665
50:56.456 --> 50:57.960
Oh, Tetris!

666
50:58.275 --> 51:00.470
Dance more like a man. You're a real man, after all.

667
51:00.478 --> 51:01.479
Here, like this.

668
51:03.704 --> 51:05.160
- One, two, three! - Manly, right?

669
51:06.275 --> 51:08.000
- Manly! - Manly! Okay!

670
51:14.500 --> 51:15.501
Phop.

671
51:17.611 --> 51:20.200
Why don't we have a barbecue like this every long weekend?

672
51:20.528 --> 51:23.880
I'll try to free up more time for the family.

673
51:27.200 --> 51:28.201
Whatever you want.

674
51:28.700 --> 51:30.001
I'm fine with whatever you decide.

675
51:40.278 --> 51:41.279
Actually,

676
51:41.958 --> 51:45.560
having fun can be as simple as this, Phop.

677
51:54.187 --> 51:55.188
Don't you think?

678
51:56.294 --> 51:57.680
Try to relax your face.

679
52:00.048 --> 52:02.320
That's better. Much better.

680
52:04.672 --> 52:05.673
Mom!

681
52:06.422 --> 52:07.760
Come do a TikTok dance with us!

682
52:08.459 --> 52:10.880
Go on, Phop. Have some fun dancing with the kids.

683
52:12.060 --> 52:14.200
Oh, no. You go ahead.

684
52:14.920 --> 52:16.960
If I tried, it'd look more like physical therapy than dancing.

685
52:17.886 --> 52:18.887
Go on.

686
52:20.904 --> 52:21.905
Come on!

687
52:26.024 --> 52:27.400
She can take my place.

688
52:27.880 --> 52:29.200
- I'm going to take a break. - Hey, where are you going?

689
52:29.400 --> 52:31.720
- You're sneaking off! - Nice escape!

690
52:32.622 --> 52:33.623
Come on.

691
52:35.600 --> 52:37.201
- Come dance with us. - Okay.

692
52:37.926 --> 52:38.927
Dance like a man.

693
52:42.880 --> 52:44.241
Aren't you going to dance with the kids?

694
52:46.784 --> 52:48.250
I'm not in the mood to dance anymore.

695
52:51.776 --> 52:52.777
Hey, Veekit.

696
52:54.520 --> 52:55.760
Have you talked to Ta lately?

697
52:56.206 --> 52:57.207
No, I haven't.

698
52:58.307 --> 52:59.640
I think she's upset with me.

699
53:01.155 --> 53:02.240
Why would she be upset with you?

700
53:03.102 --> 53:04.326
Well, I got mad at her

701
53:04.720 --> 53:07.360
for stripping you and stuffing you into that cabinet.

702
53:08.675 --> 53:10.120
So now she's upset with me for getting mad at her.

703
53:12.336 --> 53:13.960
Why do you ask, Uncle Phop?

704
53:16.470 --> 53:19.840
She suddenly blocked me on everything.

705
53:20.656 --> 53:23.157
She didn't even tell me why. I don't know what's wrong.

706
53:24.600 --> 53:27.187
I'm afraid she'll disappear again like last time.

707
53:35.043 --> 53:36.360
Want me to ask her for you?

708
53:46.438 --> 53:47.439
Hello, Ta.

709
53:49.734 --> 53:53.480
Uncle Phop just wants to know what's wrong.

710
53:54.078 --> 53:56.240
Why aren't you talking to him anymore?

711
53:58.184 --> 53:59.440
Huh? Really?

712
54:00.635 --> 54:01.636
Oh, I see.

713
54:02.080 --> 54:03.081
Okay, okay.

714
54:04.526 --> 54:06.640
Uncle Phop, Ta said

715
54:06.798 --> 54:09.171
she wants to cut ties with you for good.

716
54:09.448 --> 54:11.280
What? No way!

717
54:11.683 --> 54:12.684
Give me that.

718
54:13.107 --> 54:15.320
Ta, sweetheart. Ta.

719
54:15.360 --> 54:18.561
How could you do this to me? What's going on, Ta?

720
54:19.984 --> 54:20.985
Ta? Hello?

721
54:23.846 --> 54:24.847
Hey, Veekit!

722
54:27.296 --> 54:30.000
Why does it say the number I'm calling is unavailable?

723
54:30.939 --> 54:32.880
I was just messing with you. She didn't answer.

724
54:37.846 --> 54:38.920
You little punk.

725
54:42.246 --> 54:43.400
I'm stressed enough as it is.

726
54:51.806 --> 54:53.407
Since we announced the project,

727
54:53.410 --> 54:55.960
we've received applications from 86 developers.

728
54:56.312 --> 54:57.747
Both large and small companies.

729
54:57.813 --> 54:59.720
Their levels of experience vary.

730
55:06.374 --> 55:09.560
What if we award the contract to a small company

731
55:09.739 --> 55:12.240
with limited capital, run by young startup entrepreneurs?

732
55:12.640 --> 55:13.641
What do you think?

733
55:13.741 --> 55:14.742
That would be great.

734
55:14.837 --> 55:16.638
It would directly boost your public image,

735
55:17.020 --> 55:19.521
showing you're not favoring big corporations or colluding with powerful figures.

736
55:19.958 --> 55:22.080
You'll definitely win support from Gen Z voters.

737
55:23.238 --> 55:25.240
Okay, then...

738
55:25.603 --> 55:29.040
Find me some promising young companies with strong profiles.

739
55:29.198 --> 55:30.640
And when the e-bidding takes place,

740
55:30.760 --> 55:32.661
make sure the system is rigged without anyone noticing.

741
55:35.251 --> 55:36.252
Director.

742
55:37.078 --> 55:39.360
Ta! What kind of prank are you pulling on me this time?

743
55:39.880 --> 55:41.181
One minute you're gone, the next you're back.

744
55:41.424 --> 55:42.425
I don't know what to think anymore.

745
55:43.296 --> 55:46.520
Keeping you guessing makes our love more exciting.

746
55:49.000 --> 55:50.621
There's a package for you, ma'am.

747
55:52.344 --> 55:53.720
Thanks, handsome.

748
56:02.926 --> 56:06.000
Ma'am, that bitch Mutta sent you a package.

749
56:06.435 --> 56:08.360
Be careful. It could be dangerous.

750
56:11.208 --> 56:12.209
Sorry, ma'am.

751
56:35.456 --> 56:36.457
What is it, Touch?

752
56:39.000 --> 56:41.467
Money. There must be millions in here.

753
56:51.822 --> 56:52.823
Oh my gosh!

754
56:53.730 --> 56:56.120
Ma'am, our informant just sent us these photos.

755
56:56.339 --> 56:57.940
This just happened.

756
57:07.158 --> 57:08.360
That bitch Mutta!

757
57:20.832 --> 57:24.250
Since you came back, we haven't had sex even once.

758
57:25.120 --> 57:26.960
I'm not letting you put me off any longer.

759
57:27.328 --> 57:29.560
Wait, Director. Let's have a few drinks first.

760
57:32.240 --> 57:34.880
If you've got something good, you should share it.

761
57:34.998 --> 57:36.960
When I'm done with him, you can have him back.

762
57:37.451 --> 57:39.360
It's not like he's going to wear out.

763
57:40.131 --> 57:41.132
You bitch!

764
57:42.190 --> 57:43.191
Ms. Nin.

765
57:44.232 --> 57:45.233
I have to go now.

766
57:45.400 --> 57:46.691
Ta! Ta, wait!

767
57:46.840 --> 57:49.840
Do either of you know someone named Nin?

768
57:50.083 --> 57:51.320
Hong, do you know which Nin he's talking about?

769
57:51.600 --> 57:52.601
Nin...

770
57:54.536 --> 57:56.216
I'm going to use her daughter against her.

771
57:56.300 --> 57:57.560
What are you going to do to that girl?

772
57:58.640 --> 58:00.040
Oh! The pretty sister is here.

773
58:07.341 --> 58:08.342
Shit!
